>> It's a problem I've had both in learning Lojban and German. Learning to 
>> produce (write/speak) the language is a completely different skillset than 
>> learning to understand it, and requires a lot of feedback and corrections. 
>> Neither of the mailing lists are the place for that sort of content, nor a 
>> particularly good medium. Were I to contribute content in lojban for 
>> poems/newsletters it would place a significant editing burden on somebody, 
